@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
title YouRun · Run.status
state running
state stopping
state success
state failed
state stopped
state unknown
state "handedOff\n历史兼容" as handedOff
[*] --> running : 发布执行意图
running --> success : 命令树正常结束
running --> failed : 启动 / 执行失败
running --> stopping : 观察到 stop.json / 执行停止
running --> stopped : 启动前消费停止请求
running --> unknown : 执行器失联 / 进程组状态无法确认
stopping --> stopped : 停止完成
stopping --> success : 停止生效前已正常结束
stopping --> failed : 停止生效前已失败
stopping --> unknown : 无法确认控制者或结果
success --> [*]
failed --> [*]
stopped --> [*]
handedOff --> [*]
note right of running
  内部 phase 可为 pending / preparing /
  waiting / executing
end note
note bottom of unknown
  可能是读取时推断，不等于进程已退出
  拒绝停止与重放；后续读取可纠正观察结果
end note
note bottom of handedOff
  当前执行器不生成此状态
end note
@enduml
